@startuml
title Class structure — Author badges
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class Badge {
  +Id : Guid
  +OrganizationId : Guid
  +Name : string
  +Icon : string
  +Description : string?
  +Kind : BadgeKind
  +Rule : BadgeRule?
  +TargetId : Guid?
  +CompetencyId : Guid?
  +CreatedAt : DateTimeOffset
  +DeletedAt : DateTimeOffset?
  +Update(...)
  +Delete(at)
}
enum BadgeKind { Automatic
Manual }
enum BadgeRule { LessonCompleted
ModuleCompleted
QuizPassed
AssignmentAccepted }
class BadgeAward {
  +BadgeId : Guid
  +MembershipId : Guid
  +AwardedAt : DateTimeOffset
  +AwardedBy : string?
}
class Competency {
  +StageId : Guid?
  +RemovedAt : DateTimeOffset?
}
class BadgeCommands {
  +CreateAsync(BadgeCommand)
  +UpdateAsync(id, BadgeCommand)
  +DeleteAsync(id)
}
class BadgeRules {
  +CheckAsync(BadgeCommand) : Dictionary
}
Badge --> BadgeKind
Badge --> BadgeRule
Badge "1" o-- "*" BadgeAward : earned as
Badge ..> Competency : counts toward
BadgeCommands ..> BadgeRules
BadgeCommands ..> Badge : creates
@enduml
